{"id":546,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"探究とキリスト教教育で他者への貢献を育む","feature_description":"聖学院はキリスト教の人間理解を土台に、一人ひとりの賜物を生かし、他者のために行動する姿勢を育てます。中学の探究型授業では自ら問いを立て、調査・対話・発表を重ね、考えを伝える力を磨きます。STEAMやグローバル教育、宿泊行事などの体験を通じ、知識を現実の課題と結び付けて学ぶ機会を整えています。「Only One for Others」の理念のもと、学びを社会への貢献につなげます。","clubs":[{"id":10501,"name":"サッカー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seigakuin.ed.jp/intro/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":10502,"name":"ワンダーフォーゲル","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seigakuin.ed.jp/intro/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":10503,"name":"ラグビー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seigakuin.ed.jp/intro/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":10504,"name":"化学","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seigakuin.ed.jp/intro/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":15004,"name":"軟式野球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seigakuin.ed.jp/intro/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":15005,"name":"バドミントン","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seigakuin.ed.jp/intro/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":15006,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seigakuin.ed.jp/intro/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":15007,"name":"剣道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seigakuin.ed.jp/intro/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":15008,"name":"硬式テニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seigakuin.ed.jp/intro/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":15009,"name":"ゴルフ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seigakuin.ed.jp/intro/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":15010,"name":"卓球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seigakuin.ed.jp/intro/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":15011,"name":"陸上競技","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seigakuin.ed.jp/intro/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":15012,"name":"探検","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seigakuin.ed.jp/intro/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":15013,"name":"レゴ＆